# Integration Test Secrets Example
# 
# Copy this file to .env.secrets and fill in your actual secret values.
# DO NOT commit .env.secrets to version control!
# 
# To use:
#   1. Copy this file: cp tests/.env.secrets.example tests/.env.secrets
#   2. Fill in your actual secret values in .env.secrets
#   3. Run integration tests: RUN_INTEGRATION_TESTS=1 npm run test:integration

# Claude Code OAuth token
# Required for: Claude Code integration tests
# Get your token from: https://console.anthropic.com/
# Format: sk-ant-oat01-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=your_claude_code_oauth_token_here
